# Freenove ESP32-WROVER-E (classic ESP32-D0WD, 4MB flash / 8MB PSRAM) --
# LEAN RUNTIME (full features) / portable 4WD stand-in.  partitions_4M_ota_trim
# (1.75MB dual-OTA app slots + 448KB LittleFS), same as the 4WD.
# The full test suite does NOT fit the 448KB FS all at once, so tests are run in
# SECTIONS: w3_ai_scripts/wrover_sectioned_tests.sh uploadfs's the runtime + one tier's
# test files at a time, loads that tier's runner over serial, captures, repeats.
# Own pin map: boards/pins/Freenove-ESP32-WROVER.scm (WROVER-CAM module pinout; sonar on GPIO12/15).
# Core module set mirrors the S3 devkit (proven to boot); no motor/LED/robot HW so
# Led/Buzzer/Motor .loop just tick empty behaviour queues (harmless).

# Core runtime
core/setup.scm
core/Compiler.scm
core/Lobs.scm
core/Behaviors.scm
core/Terminal.scm
file: boards/pins/Freenove-ESP32-WROVER.scm -> Pins.scm
core/Timers.scm
core/ESP32.scm
core/CommonIO.scm
core/Buzzer.scm
core/Sonar.scm
core/WiFi.scm
core/I2C.scm
core/Wire.scm
core/PCA9685.scm
core/PCF8574.scm
core/WS2812.scm
core/LightSensor.scm
core/LCD1602.scm
core/array.scm

# R5RS/R7RS overrides
rxrs/rxrs.scm
rxrs/rxrs_cxr.scm
rxrs/rxrs_exceptions.scm
rxrs/rxrs_promises.scm
rxrs/rxrs_quasiquote.scm
rxrs/rxrs_syntax.scm

# Board-specific init
boards/Freenove-ESP32-WROVER.scm

# Serial file+command tunnel: resident LLIP receiver -- host sends (llt) then op/da/cl file
# frames and/or (ev <form>) command frames; O(N) clean, no per-char REPL echo.
features/llip-serial.scm

# Runtime defaults
runtime-defaults/Settings.scm
# Peer CA for the `network` test_id: written by _w3_run_network, absent otherwise (untracked).
optional: runtime-defaults/net-test-ca.pem -> net-test-ca.pem
# Bench WiFi credentials: untracked, absent by default, silent when absent (see .example).
optional: runtime-defaults/Settings-local.scm -> Settings-local.scm
runtime-defaults/Settings-Lamb.scm
